		(at 213.545 60.545 90)
		(descr "Non-polar 2.2 uF audio coupling capacitor, two options on one footprint: a polyester/polypropylene film box on the outer 5.0 mm holes (up to 7.8 x 7.8 mm: WIMA MKS2, TDK B32529, KEMET MMK5, Faratronic C241) or a 5 mm bipolar (non-polar) electrolytic on the inner 2.0 mm holes (Rubycon NXA, Panasonic SU). Fit one or the other.")
